list.item:
 Khan, Lieutenant General Tikka, Martial Law
Administrator and Governor of East Pakistan, February–September 1971;
Commander-in-Chief of the Pakistan Army from March 1972

person.note:
Special Assistant to President Yahya
                    for Displaced Persons and Relief and Rehabilitation Operations in East Pakistan,
                    July–September 1971; thereafter Governor of East Pakistan

Assistant to the President for International Economic Affairs, and Executive
                    Director of the Council for International Economic Policy, 1971–January 1972;
                    Secretary of Commerce, January 1972–January 1973

Assistant Director, Bureau of the Budget, 1969; Acting Deputy Director,
                    1969–1970; Assistant Director, Office of Management and Budget, 1970–1971;
                    thereafter, Chairman of the Atomic Energy Commission
